	<description>SERVITUDE IMPERPITUIS\n\nCreate and make use of servitors, lobotomised cyborg servants, for a wide variety of tasks and combat purposes. In undending labour and service of the Imperium, all sins are washed away. \n\nThis mod includes:\n- Servitorization chips/surgery\n- Replacement arms\n- Endlessly loyal cyborg servants\n\nExtra combat arm implants are available if used in conjunction with Segmentum: Children of the Omnissiah and RimDark: Mankind's Finest.\n\nServitors is part of "Segmentum", a Warhammer 40.000 modding series by REDACTED.
	</description>
